{"title":"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 9a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81a1fbb8951975f2af152b5c26c760e5adc0cfdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a,b) = \\dfrac{a}{b} + \\dfrac{b}{a} + \\dfrac{1}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"170\" height=\"39\" />. For example, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eedb031d99fdbc698f81eeb1dd3a9c5806f18e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b572a1060bdefb4735b5590601d20be7e3a637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the definition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/189a3f8380b67b3632c243ee7c4f31e40e485a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/1/ae13e2a3734bf58ce328d9099fd1f35f3590e0dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2, 5) = \\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{5}{2} + \\frac{1}{2 \\times 5} = \\frac{2 \\times 2}{5 \\times 2} + \\frac{5 \\times 5}{2 \\times 5} + \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"372\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/914f98b88daa9f3511b36ab31957d57d8347b482.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{4}{10} + \\frac{25}{10} + \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cfcddcd4af7df2f0663edbf172088dfb5116dc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{4 + 25 + 1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/4/6b4b915b757212cdf6ab599cf0b80ea641c06677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{30}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/595f39896436c3b5702098abcf3f7138f6b9f905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/189a3f8380b67b3632c243ee7c4f31e40e485a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03f3d80c623e287333588752e2ef26bfc34676e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a \\times a}{b \\times a} + \\frac{b \\times b}{a \\times b} + \\frac{1}{ab} = \\frac{a^2}{ab} + \\frac{b^2}{ab} + \\frac{1}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"290\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/a/64afea1990d17087c1c7b125da180ea9fdf4afbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{a^2 + b^2 + 1}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d2a0e6873728c2fcf5fba915b59caa41438e447.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2, 5) = \\frac{2^{2} + 5^{2} + 1}{2 \\times 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"168\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cfcddcd4af7df2f0663edbf172088dfb5116dc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{4 + 25 + 1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/4/6b4b915b757212cdf6ab599cf0b80ea641c06677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{30}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/595f39896436c3b5702098abcf3f7138f6b9f905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018011016\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 90/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 313/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4148/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.0